            ["Naked, circular DNA","Matches prokaryotic, not eukaryotic, DNA"],
            ["70S ribosomes","Matches prokaryotic ribosome size"],
            ["Transcribe/translate own proteins","Retain some prokaryote-like genetic independence"],
            ["Similar size to prokaryotes","Consistent with a once free-living cell"],
            ["Double membrane","Consistent with origin by endocytosis"]
